00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:28.240
<i>People have ended the hunt of Akakabuto.</i>

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:32.540
<i>But Gohei Takeda who only lives to
kill his arch-enemy...</i>

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:37.040
<i>...is training Silver very harshly.</i>

00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:42.840
<i>Little Silver whose father and grandfather
were killed by Akakabuto...</i>

00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:47.510
<i>...endured the training well.</i>

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:54.770
<i>One day a rival appeared,
stronger than Silver.</i>

00:01:56.030 --> 00:02:00.650
<i>Hunting dog John, who Hidetoshi
had been training abroad.</i>

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:04.410
<i>Hidetoshi is son of the mayor
who Akakabuto killed.</i>

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:09.820
<i>Silver felt that the bear-dog
within him was awoken.</i>

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:18.180
Now we know Silver's friendship is for life

00:02:20.350 --> 00:02:25.550
What is it?
Why are you squeaking...

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:34.890
I'm sorry. We don't know when
we can use the slope again.

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:41.060
Things are going badly this year.
Damned Akakabuto!

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:49.740
Fuji, what's wrong?
I suppose it's Grandpa Takeda fetching some booze.

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:54.160
Grandpa?

00:02:57.130 --> 00:02:59.130
Who is it?

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:09.470
What's happened? Answer!
Call to the hospital!

00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:18.520
Bear... a Monster-bear!
a Monster?

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:22.320
Bear with a red back!
With a red back?

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:24.780
<i>Akakabuto!</i>

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:31.410
In the pass of Naganobori.
Lay still. Doctor is coming.

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:35.370
My friends are still at the cottage.
They are out of ammunition. You must save them!

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:38.580
Daisuke, go get Grandpa!

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:47.090
Grandpa, can you stay up?
Watch out for yourself.

00:03:50.650 --> 00:03:54.420
Shigematsu!
Do you know him?

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:59.520
He's the best bear hunter in Iwate
You were attacked by Akakabuto?

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:01.810
Grandpa...!

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:14.990
That damned man-eating bear!

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:28.580
You can't go out when it's so dark!

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:31.220
I have Silver with me.

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:37.020
Come on.

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:55.990
Wait - I'm coming!
This is no childsplay.

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:59.290
Silver is a child too!

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:02.580
Hurry up!

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:23.600
What is it?

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:26.610
John!

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:36.160
Are you headed for Kotobukisawa? Then
we are going through Kurishibasawa.

00:05:36.340 --> 00:05:41.400
You must come with us, or else
you end up like your father.

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:46.670
Don't worry. He's with me.
John knows the haul -

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:49.630
After a two kilometers.

00:05:55.230 --> 00:06:01.560
Avoid the woods at night-time.
Travel through Onezudai.

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:04.690
Thanks. I was planning to.

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:18.530
Be careful. Akakabuto might
appear from anywhere.

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:24.330
<i>It was the first time when
Silver got in to a fight.</i>

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:29.420
<i>But he hadn't forgotten
the smell of Akakabuto,</i>

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:33.590
<i>when he slain his father.</i>

00:06:56.500 --> 00:07:00.530
Did you get the scent?
John, not so fast...!

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:08.710
Your snout is our light in the dark.

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:21.220
It mustn't get in here!
It's waiting outside.

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:25.600
It's quiet.
Did it give up?

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:37.200
Silver!
Hold still, Daisuke!

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:51.960
It's Akakabuto!
We are too late.

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:59.130
Silver's feet
are too small.

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:02.810
John, attack!

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:55.980
Silver!

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:03.370
Stop.
You are going to die!

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:11.750
<i>Unbelievable! Silver knew where to strike
even though I haven't taught him that..</i>

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:23.470
<i>Don't the striped bear-dogs
know fear at all...</i>

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:28.670
<i>...or was it his father's and
grandfather's heritage?</i>

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:33.730
Silver!
Shoot!

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:39.530
Are you okay?

00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:47.620
It's hopeless.
We can't hit it from here.

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:50.660
Damn!
- John!

00:10:00.270 --> 00:10:02.550
John, stay still!

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:04.470
Get down!

00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:13.600
Model 700, specially manufactured.
Now you can see it's power.

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:36.580
Unbelievable. What a skill!

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:40.300
It fell from a single shot.

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:01.230
My father's murderer!

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:09.660
It went quickly.

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:15.580
Did you see that? This can be
done only by Springfield-rifle.

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:25.840
<i>Was it the last moment of Akakabuto?
Riki didn't have a chance..</i>

00:11:32.730 --> 00:11:37.480
Silver, it is over.
We have revenged your father.

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:45.150
What is it Grandpa?
Silver says that...

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:49.870
...this isn't Akakabuto.
What do you mean?

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:53.540
Looks at it's right eye.
Look!

00:11:54.590 --> 00:12:00.630
Akakabuto didn't have a right eye.
Grandpa shot it.

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:08.720
I was afraid that this would happen.
It has grown much.

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:14.680
What do you mean?
This is Akakabuto's offspring

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:21.310
Strength, size and the color of it's fur.
He had Akakabuto's blood.

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:27.780
Does Akakabuto have more offsprings?
He is trying to build a fortress...

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:34.030
...from this entire region.
A fortress?

00:12:58.490 --> 00:13:03.520
Terrible!
What a slaughter.

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:08.680
<i>Strange barking...</i>

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:13.530
Silver, what is it?

00:13:16.050 --> 00:13:18.040
John!

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:26.250
What are they sensing?
It's here. Akakabuto.

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:45.810
<i>One eye watched them
and memorized them.</i>

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:48.110
<i>Grandpa...</i>

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:49.740
<i>Hidetoshi...</i>

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:51.200
<i>John...</i>

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:53.070
<i>Daisuke...</i>

00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:56.830
<i>Preys to kill...</i>

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:57.650
<i>But..</i>

00:13:57.660 --> 00:13:59.950
<i>Silver gave that stare back.</i>

00:14:02.510 --> 00:14:04.330
No!

00:14:05.930 --> 00:14:10.630
No! It's to soon.
You are going to die!

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:18.760
What are you waiting for? Shoot!

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:27.400
You...!

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:32.820
That's it!

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:39.200
He left. He knows the range
of our guns - even yours.

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:44.830
Goddammit! John, come here!
No!

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:52.590
You mustn't underestimate Akakabuto.
He's trying to lure you.

00:14:52.810 --> 00:14:58.260
He knows that the dark is
the only way against rifles.

00:14:58.400 --> 00:15:03.810
<i>In middle of March snowfall will get
lighter and north wind...</i>

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:12.030
<i>...will freeze the snow
so traveling gets easier.</i>

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:22.120
<i>Carefully, it's dark.
Bears will wake up in two months..</i>

00:15:22.420 --> 00:15:29.380
<i>If Grandpa is right, there,
will be many red-furred bears.</i>

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:36.840
Daisuke...!

00:15:38.310 --> 00:15:40.760
Daisuke!

00:15:57.460 --> 00:16:02.520
He fell in a pit!
Daisuke!

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:11.290
<i>Those kind of gulfs are
caused by avalanches.</i>

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:18.080
<i>If you fall between earth and snow,
the situation is hopeless..</i>

00:16:18.350 --> 00:16:24.640
<i>You can only wait for death...
Hellish traps of the Snow-mountains.</i>

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:29.310
<i>Silver, help me...!</i>

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:34.900
Grandpa, what are we going to do?

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:44.120
Daisuke, answer me!
It's too steep... and deep.

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:59.680
Silver can try
Silver?

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:07.550
He's trying to say that he can do it...
But...

00:17:07.780 --> 00:17:12.840
He's small, but as brave as an adult.

00:17:13.070 --> 00:17:19.600
He has the will to do it.
Silver wants to go down the crack

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:23.320
Let him try.
Silver, go!

00:17:30.930 --> 00:17:33.290
Good luck!

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:51.850
It's deep.
Do you think that this rope is long enough?

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:56.650
<i>Good luck. Only you can save Daisuke.</i>

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:17.630
What happened?
It just slipped.

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:40.860
It has reached the bottom and is barking

00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:45.030
He found Daisuke!

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:49.410
<i>Nothing has been won yet...</i>

00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:08.100
Grab the rope, Daisuke!
I can't hear anything

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:12.680
Daisuke must be unconscious.
Then there's nothing we can do.

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:18.900
If Daisuke won't awake, there's
nothing that a small puppy can do.

00:19:19.990 --> 00:19:23.360
Daisuke, wake up! Grab the rope!

00:19:23.910 --> 00:19:27.110
<i>Daisuke!</i>

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:34.200
<i>Is this hopeless?
Silver...</i>

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:46.090
<i>Silver tied the rope
around Daisuke...</i>

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:10.200
Grandpa! John tries to say something.
Yes I hear it. He tells to pull.

00:20:18.970 --> 00:20:21.710
It's heavy!

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:33.970
<i>Daisuke is still unconscious...
How could Silver do it...</i>

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:40.760
<i>Daisuke's weight was on Silver's neck.
It was painful.</i>

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:46.440
<i>He almost lost consciousness,
but he had do hold on.</i>

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:52.120
<i>It was a fight of life and death,
and Silver was doing great.</i>

00:20:53.290 --> 00:20:59.710
<i>The rope supported Daisuke's and
Silver's bodies and lives..</i>

00:21:09.890 --> 00:21:15.310
There they are!
Terrific! Good job!

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:20.090
Daisuke!
He's only unconscious.

00:21:20.450 --> 00:21:22.650
Silver!
Daisuke!

00:21:24.490 --> 00:21:29.700
Silver!
It still holds on to the rope.

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:37.750
John, this time you can feel inferior.

00:21:39.510 --> 00:21:42.540
He awakes!

00:21:42.760 --> 00:21:48.960
Dad!
We're lucky! I was so scared.

00:21:54.270 --> 00:21:59.680
Grandpa...
You fool. There are better ways.

00:22:07.030 --> 00:22:09.940
Grandpa pats Silver...

00:22:10.250 --> 00:22:12.320
Here...

00:22:12.540 --> 00:22:14.620
Silver!

00:22:15.590 --> 00:22:19.120
You saved my life.

00:22:22.430 --> 00:22:27.660
Next time it's my turn.

00:22:35.400 --> 00:22:40.140
<i>Nights are cold on the mountains
in the middle of March..</i>

00:22:40.360 --> 00:22:47.400
<i>Daisuke's and Silver's hearts
were bounded by friendship and trust.</i>
